&lt;p&gt;👶&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Enhanced parental leave&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- 3 months full pay paternity and 6 months full pay maternity leave, to provide extra flexibility during the moments that matter most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🍼&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;YellowNest nursery scheme&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- to help working parents manage childcare costs.&lt;/p&gt;
