&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What a day might look like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collaborate with data scientists and machine learning engineers to ship physics models to our customers in a way that delivers maximum value. Work with designers and front-end engineers to shape the UX in line with customer needs.&lt;/div&gt;
